    "reason": "The only evidence [ev-1252a2a51c0c] says the networking.istio.io/exportTo annotation now accepts extra white space between namespaces. It does not say which resource kinds carry or read that annotation. The proposed list (VirtualService, DestinationRule, ServiceEntry, Gateway) is not in the evidence or the section context. The condition is also too broad: flagging every resource that sets the annotation ignores that only values with white space between namespaces are affected, and the note describes a relaxation with no stated failure. We need upstream text naming the kinds that read the annotation, and saying whether anything changes for values that are already valid.",
